32. Build message rendering function
33. Implement user input form with submission
34. Add real-time message display (append as they come)
35. Create loading indicators during API calls
36. Implement error message display
37. Add message styling (user vs. tutor messages)
38. Create a clear/reset button
39. Add copy-to-clipboard functionality
40. Implement message timestamps in UI
41. Create a scrolling auto-scroll to latest message
42. Build a sidebar for conversation history
43. Add dark/light theme toggle
44. Implement responsive design for mobile
45. Create keyboard shortcuts (Enter to send, etc.)

### **Phase 4: Advanced Features (Tasks 46–60) – Production Ready**
46. Implement stop/cancel request mid-stream
47. Add streaming response support (if available)
48. Create a settings panel (model selection, temperature)
49. Build export functionality (save conversations as JSON/PDF)
50. Implement analytics (track usage, response times)
51. Add multi-language support
